      "name": "@local/dsh-sticky-wall",
      "title": {
        "en": "Sticky Wall · 便签墙",
        "zh": "便签墙 Sticky Wall"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A sticky-note wall and a session bookmark index in the left sidebar: capture an idea, pin what matters, and bookmark selected chat text by session. Open a bookmark to expand collapsed process layers, jump back to its exact words, and mark them clearly; archiving a session removes its bookmarks.",
        "zh": "左侧栏里的便签墙：灵感来的一瞬间就能记下，重要的置顶，以后用搜索找回；在会话里选中文字还能收藏成书签，按会话索引，点书签会展开折叠过程、跳回原文字并醒目标出，会话归档后自动消失。"
      },
