    {
      "name": "@local/dsh-gamepad-voice",
      "title": {
        "en": "Controller & voice",
        "zh": "手柄与语音"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Drive DSH from an Xbox One controller and replace typing with local speech. The left-sidebar page labels every action with its Xbox One button: the D-pad switches sessions and panels, A sends the draft, B stops the reply, X starts a new session, holding LB for about half a second switches where a transcript goes, RB cycles the recognition language, View returns to the conversation, and Menu opens this page; while a controller is connected the same hints appear in a bar at the lower-left. Holding Y records speech that is transcribed into the current draft. Audio is transcribed on this machine by the Voice input plugin's SenseVoice service and is never uploaded; the plugin stores only its settings in this browser. Speech requires the Voice input plugin (it provides the transcription service); the page offers working links to open Plugins or prepare its model, and a window blur, controller disconnect, or Escape ends recording.",
        "zh": "用 Xbox One 手柄操作 DSH，用本机语音转写代替打字。左侧栏页面按 Xbox One 键位标注每个动作：十字键切换会话与面板，A 发送草稿，B 停止回复，X 新建会话，按住 LB 约半秒切换转写去向，RB 切换识别语言，View 返回对话，Menu 打开本页；连接手柄时窗口左下角还会显示同样的按键提示条。按住 Y 说话，松开后转写并进入当前草稿。录音由「语音输入」插件的 SenseVoice 在本机转写，不会上传；插件只在这个浏览器里保存设置。语音功能需要启用「语音输入」插件（转写服务由它提供），页面会给出打开插件页或准备模型的入口；窗口失焦、手柄断开或按 Esc 会结束录音。"
      },
