      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Edit semantic, episodic, and procedural memory separately from the left sidebar. Saved text is added to every turn, so answers follow your habits and preferences. Memory lives in three markdown files on this machine that you can read, edit, or clear at any time.",
        "zh": "在左侧栏分别编辑语义记忆、情节记忆和过程记忆；保存后，每一轮对话都会带上这些内容，回答更贴合你平时的做法与偏好。记忆以三个 markdown 文件存在本机，随时能看、能改、能清空。"
